   copyright or license header today. Add the SPDX header shown below to
   each file.


2. GPL-2.0-only
   OpenEmbedded-Core busybox recipe (poky/meta/recipes-core/busybox/files/busybox-httpd)
-----------------
   Installed:
   /etc/init.d/busybox-httpd  /etc/init.d/busybox-inetd

   busybox-httpd is the oe-core busybox-httpd init script with HTTPROOT
   changed to /www; busybox-inetd is derived from the same script. Both
   inherit the busybox recipe license GPL-2.0-only.



